        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Katrina Bowden, Sean Anders, Josh Zuckerman, Amanda Crew, Clark Duke, Seth Green, James Marsden, Alice Greczyn, Michael Cudlitz, Dave Sheridan, David Koechner\n- Products: 30 Rock, Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD, Scary Movie 5\n- Roles: actress, director, supporting roles\n\nFacts:\n- Katrina Bowden was born on September 19, 1988, and she is an American actress.\n- From 2006 to 2013, Katrina Bowden was best known for playing Cerie on the NBC sitcom 30 Rock.\n- Katrina Bowden also appeared in the films Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD, and Scary Movie 5.\n- Sean Anders directed the film Sex Drive.\n- Sex Drive stars Josh Zuckerman, Amanda Crew, Clark Duke, Seth Green, and James Marsden.\n- In Sex Drive, Katrina Bowden, Alice Greczyn, Michael Cudlitz, Dave Sheridan, and David Koechner appear in supporting roles.",
